OL,3,AMet Police officer charged after BBC
OL,4,ACharing Cross investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Metropolitan Police officer has
OL,7,Fbecome the first person to be charged
OL,8,Fas a result of a BBC Panorama
OL,9,Finvestigation into alleged misconduct
OL,10,Fat Charing Cross police station in
OL,11,FLondon.
OL,13,FSgt Sadiq Al-Hasani, 37, has been
OL,14,Fcharged with perverting the course of
OL,15,Fjustice.
OL,17,FHe will appear at Westminster
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
