OL,3,AMet Police officer charged after BBC
OL,4,ACharing Cross investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the Met Police said the
OL,7,Fcharge related to an allegation Sgt
OL,8,FAl-Hasani, who was attached to Central
OL,9,FWest Command Unit, "deliberately sought
OL,10,Fto discourage another officer from
OL,11,Fmaking a statement to the Independent
OL,12,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC)".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
